      "timestamp_raw": "Oct 8, 2013 16:00:31 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "Some new photos, taken 10/6/13.  S. roseas always look their best for me in the fall:<br/><img src=\"http://farm8.staticflickr.com/7313/10149046244_30f79a9d8b.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"http://farm4.staticflickr.com/3731/10149276313_c84df5c81f.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"http://farm8.staticflickr.com/7293/10149225316_4d167cb891.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>Look at how bright red these can get on the interior of the trap!<br/><img src=\"http://farm4.staticflickr.com/3793/10149226296_bf7ee0e165.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/>These form nice clumps over time.  I have this one in a 4.5\" pot, and they seem to like being a little big crowded:<br/><img src=\"http://farm4.staticflickr.com/3793/10149228186_9c80a2e595.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><img src=\"http://farm8.staticflickr.com/7331/10149151055_4cae614d87.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"http://farm6.staticflickr.com/5510/10149152145_9d0c615192.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><a href=\"http://www.flickr.com/photos/63000221@N05/10149054054/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://farm8.staticflickr.com/7379/10149054054_5fc38ec8bb.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><br/><a href=\"http://www.flickr.com/photos/63000221@N05/10149054054/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. rosea Mobile Co, AL</a> by <a href=\"http://www.flickr.com/people/63000221@N05/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">meizzwang</a>, on Flickr",
